sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Utente
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BC as BugController
    participant BS as BugService
    participant UR as UserRepository
    participant LR as LabelRepository
    participant BR as BugRepository
    participant HR as HistoryRepository

    U->>FE: Compila form creazione bug
    Note over FE: Titolo, descrizione,<br/>tipo, priorità, label

    FE->>BC: POST /api/bugs<br/>BugCreateRequest + JWT Cookie

    BC->>BC: Estrai userId dal JWT
    BC->>BS: create(request, userId)

    BS->>UR: findById(userId)
    alt Utente non trovato
        UR-->>BS: Optional.empty()
        BS-->>BC: EntityNotFoundException
        BC-->>FE: 404 Not Found
        FE-->>U: Messaggio di errore
    else Utente trovato
        UR-->>BS: Optional(User)

        BS->>BS: new Bug(title, description, type, user)
        BS->>BS: setPriority(priority)
        BS->>BS: setDeadline(deadline)

        opt Labels presenti nella request
            loop Per ogni label name
                BS->>LR: findByName(labelName)
                alt Label esistente
                    LR-->>BS: Optional(Label)
                else Label nuova
                    LR-->>BS: Optional.empty()
                    BS->>LR: save(new Label(name))
                    LR-->>BS: Label salvata
                end
                BS->>BS: bug.getLabels().add(label)
            end
        end

        BS->>BR: save(bug)
        BR-->>BS: Bug salvato (con ID)

        BS->>HR: save(new History(bug, user, CREATE))
        HR-->>BS: History salvata

        BS-->>BC: Bug creato
        BC-->>FE: 200 OK + Bug JSON
        FE-->>U: Redirect a dettaglio bug
    end
